## v2: intake

- [ ] extract intake schema from uploaded examples
- [ ] accuity integration
  - [ ] ingest webhooks to keep schedule up to date
  - [ ] assoicate schedule items with drs, can hopefully just use email
- [ ] email/sms to send the user a text
- [ ] summarization job for the accuity data
- [ ] unique link gen for each patient, automatically expiring links
- [ ] chat experience
  - [ ] Enter in their DOB to access the page
  - [ ] frontend hits /questions API to get a dict of questions to ask {id: "question", question: "long question"}
  - [ ] ui chatbot goes back and forth with a user to ask questions and persist to the DB
  - [ ] /followup is hit to generate a set of follow-up questions via a model
  - [ ] go through follow-up questions in the ui
- [ ] summarization job after the intake is complete
- [ ] present accuity & chat summarization in the ui

ai issues to consider

- [ ] how to keep it on the rails? Easy to pull these bots off-script.
- [ ] how do you stop asking questions? How do you know when you are done?
- [ ] How to assess quality of the answers?

user flow

1. doctor uploads example intake
2. extract intake schema & answers
3. patient visits intake page
4. patient is given a chat-like experience to collect answers for the intake questions
5. next, we feed the answers into the model and get a list of follow-up questions from the model to ask
6. we run through the follow-up questions the model has chosen and close the session

